We have some good news to kick the year off with,&nbsp;
including specifically that radical Republican&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.840
Congresswoman Marjorie Taylor Greene has been&nbsp;
banned permanently from Twitter. We will get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:26.960
to that a little bit later in the day, but we&nbsp;
have to start with some words of caution. And&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:34.080
we have now heard from three military&nbsp;
retired military generals who are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:41.520
sounding the alarm and saying in&nbsp;
2024, it's not just a Republican coup&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:48.880
that you have to worry about. You have to&nbsp;
worry about a military coup. One of the reasons&nbsp;&nbsp;

