that Trump's coup attempt didn't work was that&nbsp;
he's very incompetent, of course, and he did not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:01.520
have the military on his side. Now there's no&nbsp;
shortage of support for Trump in the military,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:07.040
but he didn't have the generals on his side. And&nbsp;
what these three retired generals are pointing to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:13.120
is the possibility that that could be different&nbsp;
in 2024. It doesn't necessarily have to be. Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:18.080
could be a different Republican, and they are&nbsp;
now saying, you've got to be careful about&nbsp;&nbsp;

