military could instigate it. The generals,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:49.920
Paul Eaton, Antonio Taguba and Steven Anderson,&nbsp;
made their case in a Washington Post op ed quote.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:54.800
In short, we are chilled to our bones at&nbsp;
the thought of a coup succeeding next time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.160 --> 00:02:00.800
they have. These are highlights from a&nbsp;
conversation you can listen to, and I encourage&nbsp;&nbsp;

