00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:14.560
who the duly elected president is? If that is not&nbsp;
a clear cut understanding that can infect the rank&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:22.400
and file or at any level in the U.S. military?&nbsp;
And we saw it when 124 retired generals and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:27.120
admirals signed a letter contesting the 2020&nbsp;
election. We're concerned about that. We're&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:32.000
interested in seeing mitigating measures applied&nbsp;
to make sure the military is better prepared.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:43.040
This is a crucial point. We lucked out in a sense&nbsp;
that Trump and his cronies were too incompetent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:49.840
and poorly organized to pull it off. And in&nbsp;
addition, if it ever got to the point of actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

